{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "02905",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.03,
      "end_seconds": 7.9,
      "duration_seconds": 6.87,
      "text": "Erm, doctor, hi, where would you like me to put my coat?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 8.47,
      "end_seconds": 12.09,
      "duration_seconds": 3.62,
      "text": "No problem at all, come in. What's troubling you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 13.65,
      "end_seconds": 19.93,
      "duration_seconds": 6.28,
      "text": "doctor, I've come along because I know the history, if it helps"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 20.82,
      "end_seconds": 24.45,
      "duration_seconds": 3.63,
      "text": "Good, that'll be useful. Pull up a chair."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 25.79,
      "end_seconds": 30.56,
      "duration_seconds": 4.77,
      "text": "I'm here because of bright red blood on the paper."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 31.86,
      "end_seconds": 34.73,
      "duration_seconds": 2.87,
      "text": "What's the timeline, when did it begin?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 35.59,
      "end_seconds": 54.54,
      "duration_seconds": 18.95,
      "text": "I've had it for about four days. As for lump around the back passage, I honestly can't say when that began. It might have been last month or the month before. I've also had itching, for six months"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 59.14,
      "end_seconds": 62.21,
      "duration_seconds": 3.07,
      "text": "How troublesome is it day to day?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 63.24,
      "end_seconds": 64.23,
      "duration_seconds": 0.99,
      "text": "Mostly moderate."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 68.66,
      "end_seconds": 71.38,
      "duration_seconds": 2.72,
      "text": "Have you had any surgical procedures?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 72.42,
      "end_seconds": 77.75,
      "duration_seconds": 5.33,
      "text": "yes, I had my septum straightened, in my thirties"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 78.95,
      "end_seconds": 81.69,
      "duration_seconds": 2.74,
      "text": "do you follow any particular diet?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 83.51,
      "end_seconds": 86.64,
      "duration_seconds": 3.13,
      "text": "I'm vegetarian and have been for years"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 87.42,
      "end_seconds": 88.86,
      "duration_seconds": 1.44,
      "text": "What's your work?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 90.95,
      "end_seconds": 95.39,
      "duration_seconds": 4.44,
      "text": "I'm a plumber, lots of bending and kneeling."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 96.71,
      "end_seconds": 100.42,
      "duration_seconds": 3.71,
      "text": "What do you take on a normal day?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 102.5,
      "end_seconds": 123.97,
      "duration_seconds": 21.47,
      "text": "She is on clopidogrel, 75 milligrams, once a day for the stent, I give it to her. She is on levetiracetam, 500 milligrams, twice a day, I give it to her. Okay, so it's alendronate, 70 milligrams, once a week for my bones, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 124.48,
      "end_seconds": 127.04,
      "duration_seconds": 2.56,
      "text": "Carbamazepine I don't take anymore."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 127.96,
      "end_seconds": 132.79,
      "duration_seconds": 4.83,
      "text": "any allergies to tablets, food or anything in the the environment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 134.24,
      "end_seconds": 139.84,
      "duration_seconds": 5.6,
      "text": "I'm allergic to amoxicillin, I get hives. Yes, diclofenac. I get wheezing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 152.83,
      "end_seconds": 155.17,
      "duration_seconds": 2.34,
      "text": "Do you have any long-term conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 159.74,
      "end_seconds": 161.23,
      "duration_seconds": 1.49,
      "text": "Yes, heart disease."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 162.61,
      "end_seconds": 163.37,
      "duration_seconds": 0.76,
      "text": "Mm-hmm."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 165.35,
      "end_seconds": 170.87,
      "duration_seconds": 5.52,
      "text": "I've had epilepsy for five years now. I've had thin bones, yes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 172.08,
      "end_seconds": 180.27,
      "duration_seconds": 8.19,
      "text": "Right, so heart disease and epilepsy are already on your record. We'll keep that in mind today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 191.69,
      "end_seconds": 197.28,
      "duration_seconds": 5.59,
      "text": "Any tummy pain, weight loss, change in bowel habit or black stools?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 198.7,
      "end_seconds": 207.25,
      "duration_seconds": 8.55,
      "text": "No tummy pain, weight loss, change in bowel habit or black stools, none of it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 209.3,
      "end_seconds": 213.65,
      "duration_seconds": 4.35,
      "text": "Alright, on the cardiac side, anything I should know?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 214.99,
      "end_seconds": 216.54,
      "duration_seconds": 1.55,
      "text": "nothing like that"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 218.2,
      "end_seconds": 221.86,
      "duration_seconds": 3.66,
      "text": "Let me get the readings out of the way."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 229.02,
      "end_seconds": 231.44,
      "duration_seconds": 2.42,
      "text": "Nearly done with the readings..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 250.44,
      "end_seconds": 256.41,
      "duration_seconds": 5.97,
      "text": "Okay: pulse 70, temperature 36.5, pressure 126 over 82, respiratory rate 18."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 258.19,
      "end_seconds": 262.1,
      "duration_seconds": 3.91,
      "text": "Now I'm going to do a short physical check."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 263.93,
      "end_seconds": 266.19,
      "duration_seconds": 2.26,
      "text": "I'm just checking this side."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 273.47,
      "end_seconds": 280.92,
      "duration_seconds": 7.45,
      "text": "There is a soft swelling at the edge of the back passage and a non-tender rectum with no mass."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 282.99,
      "end_seconds": 284.04,
      "duration_seconds": 1.05,
      "text": "Okay, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 286.3,
      "end_seconds": 296.4,
      "duration_seconds": 10.1,
      "text": "That's the examination finished. Putting it all together, it points towards haemorrhoids. It could also be an anal fissure, so we'll keep that open."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 297.21,
      "end_seconds": 300.41,
      "duration_seconds": 3.2,
      "text": "Is there something to worry about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 301.3,
      "end_seconds": 309.44,
      "duration_seconds": 8.14,
      "text": "It's reasonable to be concerned, but right now haemorrhoids is my leading thought, not anything worse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 321.31,
      "end_seconds": 325.07,
      "duration_seconds": 3.76,
      "text": "We should do a blood count for rectal bleeding."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 325.7,
      "end_seconds": 328.81,
      "duration_seconds": 3.11,
      "text": "Where would I go for that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 330.03,
      "end_seconds": 350.62,
      "duration_seconds": 20.59,
      "text": "I'd like you to take a haemorrhoid cream, 1 application, twice a day, one week. That should help with haemorrhoids. Eat more fibre and and drink water. Keep an eye out, and if the symptoms get worse, call us the same day or go to emergency."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 352.59,
      "end_seconds": 355.9,
      "duration_seconds": 3.31,
      "text": "Okay, I'll look out for that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 356.88,
      "end_seconds": 363.97,
      "duration_seconds": 7.09,
      "text": "Let's review you in four weeks. That's everything on my side. Anything you're unsure about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 365.55,
      "end_seconds": 368.33,
      "duration_seconds": 2.78,
      "text": "I think I understand everything thanks"
    }
  ]
}